s cannot be an afterthought when building on the ServiceNow AI Platform. Defining KPIs and reporting needs during app design ensures that data is captured correctly and supports dashboards, performance metrics, and decision-making.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/application-development/planning-analytics-analysis.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":1,"breadcrumb":["Plan your app before you start building","Getting Started guide for developers","Building applications"],"tags":["#application-development","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/application-development/planning-analytics-analysis.md"},
